 "snippet": "    // L7 — THE MOAT. One gate, plugged. Crossing on foot costs everything.\n    make(\n      7,\n      [\n        king(1, 8), pawn(4, 6), queen(8, 5), queen(3, 2),\n      ],\n      {\n        ...FLEE,\n        moveLimit: 11,\n        hazards: [X(1, 4), X(2, 4), X(3, 4), X(5, 4), X(6, 4), X(7, 4), X(8, 4), X(4, 5), X(3, 8), X(2, 6), X(3, 7)],\n        kingPen: ['a7', 'b7', 'a8', 'b8'],\n      },\n    ),"
